        "procedure": "O-vanillin (61 mg, 0.4 mmol) and DAMN (22 mg, 0.2 mmol) were refluxed in MeOH (15 mL) for 2 h, then cooled to room temperature. GdCl3·6H2O (150 mg, 0.4 mmol) was added and stirred briefly, followed by triethylamine (20 mg, 0.2 mmol). The solution was refluxed for an additional 30 min, cooled, and filtered. The filtrate was left for slow evaporation; brown single crystals suitable for X-ray diffraction formed within 4 days, were collected by filtration, washed with cold methanol, and dried in air.",
